---
layout: base.njk
pageTitle: "Foundation Dental Center | Fixed Teeth, Planned and Placed by One Surgeon — Bonita Springs, FL"
pageDesc: "Dr. John Pasicznyk plans your case, performs your surgery, and restores your new teeth — with a board-certified MD anesthesiologist for your comfort. Bonita Springs, FL."
---

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <span class="eyebrow">Bonita Springs, Florida</span>
      <h1 id="hero-heading">Fixed Teeth, Planned and Placed by One Surgeon</h1>
      <p class="hero-subhead">
        If missing teeth or a denture that won't stay put has changed the way you eat, smile, and speak, there is a path forward. Dr. John Pasicznyk plans your case, performs your surgery, and restores your new teeth — with IV sedation or general anesthesia from a board-certified MD anesthesiologist.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/contact#schedule" class="btn-primary btn-lg">Schedule a Consultation</a>
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneRaw }}" class="btn-outline btn-lg">{{ site.phone }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-photo" aria-hidden="true">
    <img
      src="/assets/photos/02_cutout_white-coat_blue-shirt_2023.png"
      alt=""
      class="hero-cutout"
      width="620" height="780"
      loading="eager"
    />
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TRUST BAR -->
<section class="section-white" style="padding-block: var(--space-lg);" aria-label="Practice highlights">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="trust-row">
      <div class="trust-badge fade-up">
        <svg width="20" height="20" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"/></svg>
        One Surgeon, Start to Finish
      </div>
      <div class="trust-badge fade-up">
        <svg width="20" height="20" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
        MD Anesthesiologists
      </div>
      <div class="trust-badge fade-up">
        <svg width="20" height="20" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 3H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v4m6-6h10a2 2 0 012 2v4M9 3v18m0 0h10a2 2 0 002-2V9M9 21H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V9m0 0h18"/></svg>
        3D Cone-Beam Planning
      </div>
      <div class="trust-badge fade-up">
        <svg width="20" height="20" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
        Mon–Thu 9–4, Bonita Springs
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CREDIBILITY STATS (conditional on content/bio.json) -->
{% if siteContent.bio and siteContent.bio.stats and siteContent.bio.stats.length %}
<section class="stats-strip" aria-label="Practice highlights">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="stats-row">
      {% for stat in siteContent.bio.stats %}
      <div class="stat-item fade-up">
        <span class="stat-value">{{ stat.value }}</span>
        <span class="stat-label">{{ stat.label }}</span>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<!-- PROBLEM / EMPATHY -->
<section class="section-light" aria-labelledby="problem-heading">
  <div class="container content-split">
    <div class="fade-up">
      <span class="eyebrow">You Shouldn't Have to Live With This</span>
      <h2 id="problem-heading">Missing Teeth Change Everything</h2>
      <span class="gold-rule"></span>
      <p>You avoid certain foods. You cover your mouth when you laugh. You skip photos. Little by little, you start planning your life around your teeth.</p>
      <p>Conventional dentures shift and slip. Missing teeth let the jawbone shrink over time, changing the shape of your face. Waiting rarely makes treatment simpler.</p>
      <p>There is a better answer: teeth that are fixed, stable, and planned to last.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fade-up">
      <img
        src="/assets/photos/showing-model_2022_979x694.jpg"
        alt="Dr. Pasicznyk explaining treatment with a model"
        class="content-photo"
        style="max-width:600px;"
        width="979" height="694"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TESTIMONIALS (conditional) -->
{% if site.showTestimonials and siteContent.testimonials and siteContent.testimonials.length %}
<section class="section-white" aria-labelledby="testimonials-home-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fade-up text-center" style="max-width:640px;margin-inline:auto;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Patient Stories</span>
      <h2 id="testimonials-home-heading" class="section-heading">What Patients Say</h2>
      <span class="gold-rule" style="margin-inline:auto;"></span>
    </div>
    {% include "testimonials.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<!-- ABOUT / DOCTOR -->
<section class="section-white" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="container content-split reverse">
    <div class="fade-up">
      <span class="eyebrow">Meet Your Surgeon</span>
      <h2 id="about-heading">{{ site.doctor }}</h2>
      <span class="gold-rule"></span>
      <p>Implant treatment often passes through several hands. At Foundation, one doctor sees it through. Dr. Pasicznyk plans your case, performs your surgery, and restores your final teeth.</p>
      <p>A graduate of {{ site.doctorSchool }}, he has served as faculty and mentor with 3D Dentists and Implant Pathway, teaching implant surgery to other dentists. He is also a clinical advisor to Dentsply Sirona on same-day digital dentistry and 3D cone-beam imaging.</p>
      <p>Your procedure is supported by a board-certified MD anesthesiologist whose only job in the room is your comfort and safety.</p>
      <a href="/meet-the-doctor" class="btn-outline" style="margin-top:var(--space-md)">Meet Dr. Pasicznyk</a>
    </div>
    <div class="fade-up">
      <img
        src="/assets/photos/08_scrubs_4x5_787x984.jpg"
        alt="Dr. John Pasicznyk"
        class="content-photo"
        style="max-width:450px;"
        width="787" height="984"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SERVICES -->
<section class="section-light" aria-labelledby="services-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center fade-up">
      <span class="eyebrow">What We Do</span>
      <h2 id="services-heading" class="section-heading">Implant &amp; Restorative Solutions</h2>
      <p class="section-subhead" style="margin-inline:auto;">Every treatment at Foundation Dental Center starts with a conversation. Then a plan. Then precision.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid" style="margin-top:var(--space-xl);">
      <a href="/full-arch-fixed" class="card fade-up" style="text-decoration:none;">
        <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Full-Arch Fixed Implants</h3>
        <p>A full arch of fixed, non-removable teeth supported by implants. Many patients leave surgery day with teeth.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/single-implants" class="card fade-up" style="text-decoration:none;">
        <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 1v4M12 19v4M4.22 4.22l2.83 2.83M16.95 16.95l2.83 2.83M1 12h4M19 12h4M4.22 19.78l2.83-2.83M16.95 7.05l2.83-2.83"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Single &amp; Multiple Implants</h3>
        <p>Replace one tooth or several with implants that look, feel, and function like natural teeth.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/implant-dentures" class="card fade-up" style="text-decoration:none;">
        <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 6h16M4 10h16M4 14h16M4 18h16"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Implant Dentures</h3>
        <p>Dentures that snap securely onto implants — far more stable than a conventional denture.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/bone-grafting" class="card fade-up" style="text-decoration:none;">
        <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Bone Grafting</h3>
        <p>Rebuild the bone needed for long-term implant success when volume has been lost.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/zygomatic-implants" class="card fade-up" style="text-decoration:none;">
        <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Zygomatic Implants</h3>
        <p>For severe bone loss in the upper jaw: implants anchored in the cheekbone instead of the jaw.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/restorative-dentistry" class="card fade-up" style="text-decoration:none;">
        <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 3v4M3 5h4M6 17v4m-2-2h4m5-16l2.286 6.857L21 12l-5.714 2.143L13 21l-2.286-6.857L5 12l5.714-2.143L13 3z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Restorative Dentistry</h3>
        <p>Crowns, bridges, and full-mouth restoration to bring damaged teeth back to full function, with some lab work done in-house.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="text-center" style="margin-top:var(--space-lg);">
      <a href="/anesthesia" class="btn-outline">Comfort &amp; Anesthesia Options</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- IS THIS FOR ME -->
<section class="section-dark" aria-labelledby="fit-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center fade-up">
      <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--gold)">Is This Right for You?</span>
      <h2 id="fit-heading" class="section-heading" style="color:var(--ivory)">You May Be a Candidate If…</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid-2x2" style="margin-top:var(--space-xl);">
      <div class="card fade-up" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
        <h3 style="color:var(--ivory);">You've lost one or more teeth</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--light-gray);">From injury, infection, or decay. Implants restore teeth that look and work like your own.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card fade-up" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
        <h3 style="color:var(--ivory);">Your denture doesn't stay put</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--light-gray);">Implant-supported options restore stability, chewing power, and confidence a removable denture can't match.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card fade-up" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
        <h3 style="color:var(--ivory);">You were told you don't have enough bone</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--light-gray);">Bone grafting and zygomatic implants are options for many patients who were turned away elsewhere.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card fade-up" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
        <h3 style="color:var(--ivory);">You've been putting this off</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--light-gray);">IV sedation or general anesthesia, an MD anesthesiologist, and an unhurried process make even complex treatment approachable.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="fade-up" style="margin-top:var(--space-xl);padding:var(--space-lg);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);max-width:680px;margin-inline:auto;">
      <p style="font-weight:600;color:var(--ivory);font-size:0.9375rem;">Told you don't have enough bone?</p>
      <p style="margin-top:0.5rem;color:var(--light-gray);">Severe upper-jaw bone loss doesn't always disqualify you. <a href="/zygomatic-implants" style="color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;">Zygomatic implants</a> anchor in the cheekbone and extend candidacy for many patients who were turned away elsewhere.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="text-center fade-up" style="margin-top:var(--space-xl);">
      <a href="/faq" class="btn-outline" style="border-color:rgba(246,241,231,0.4);color:var(--ivory);">Have Questions? Read Our FAQ</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- YOUR JOURNEY (Process) -->
<section class="section-white" aria-labelledby="journey-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="process-split">
      <div class="process-left">
        <div class="fade-up" style="max-width:580px;">
          <span class="eyebrow">What to Expect</span>
          <h2 id="journey-heading" class="section-heading">Your Path to Fixed Teeth</h2>
          <span class="gold-rule"></span>
          <p>We don't hand you a treatment plan on the first call. We start with a conversation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="steps" style="margin-top:var(--space-xl);">
          <div class="step fade-up">
            <div class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">1</div>
            <div>
              <h3>Consultation</h3>
              <p>Meet Dr. Pasicznyk — the same doctor who will perform your surgery and restore your teeth. Talk through your goals, history, and budget. No pressure, no upsell.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step fade-up">
            <div class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">2</div>
            <div>
              <h3>Imaging &amp; Planning</h3>
              <p>3D cone-beam imaging shows your bone and anatomy precisely. Every implant position is planned digitally, and you review the plan and the fee before anything is scheduled.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step fade-up">
            <div class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">3</div>
            <div>
              <h3>Treatment Day</h3>
              <p>A board-certified MD anesthesiologist provides your IV sedation or general anesthesia. For many full-arch patients, a fixed set of provisional teeth goes in the same day.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step fade-up">
            <div class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">4</div>
            <div>
              <h3>Healing &amp; Final Teeth</h3>
              <p>Over a few months, the implants fuse with your bone (osseointegration). Then your final teeth are made and placed.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="fade-up" style="margin-top:var(--space-lg);font-size:0.9375rem;color:var(--mid-gray);font-style:italic;">Here for the season? We'll map your treatment around your time in Florida. Bring your dates to your consultation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-right fade-up">
        <img
          src="/assets/photos/wide_reviewing-CBCT_2022_1647x657.jpg"
          alt="Dr. Pasicznyk reviewing a 3D cone-beam scan with a patient"
          class="content-photo"
          width="1647" height="657"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- RESULTS PHILOSOPHY -->
<section class="section-light" aria-labelledby="results-heading">
  <div class="container content-split">
    <div class="fade-up">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our Philosophy</span>
      <h2 id="results-heading">Built Right Because the Foundation Comes First</h2>
      <span class="gold-rule"></span>
      <p>Our name isn't an accident. Every implant, every restoration, every plan starts with the foundation: the bone, the bite, the biology.</p>
      <p>Shortcuts in planning cost patients later. We don't take them. We take the time to do it correctly, so what we build for you is built to stay.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fade-up">
      <img
        src="/assets/photos/showing-model_bonita-2023_1283x972.jpg"
        alt="Dr. Pasicznyk reviewing a treatment model with a patient"
        class="content-photo"
        style="max-width:600px;"
        width="1283" height="972"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- LEAD FORM -->
<section class="section-white" aria-labelledby="lead-home-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="max-width:620px;margin-inline:auto;">
      <h2 id="lead-home-heading" class="section-heading fade-up" style="text-align:center;">Ready to Start a Conversation?</h2>
      {% include "lead-form.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta-section" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
  <div class="container fade-up">
    <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--gold)">Ready to Start?</span>
    <h2 id="cta-heading">Take the First Step</h2>
    <p>Book online or call us. We'll have a real conversation about your situation, and you'll leave knowing your options.</p>
    <div class="cta-actions">
      <a href="/contact#schedule" class="btn-primary btn-lg">Schedule a Consultation</a>
      <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneRaw }}" class="btn-outline btn-lg">{{ site.phone }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- LOCATION -->
<section class="location-strip" aria-labelledby="location-heading">
  <div class="container location-inner">
    <div class="fade-up">
      <span class="eyebrow">Find Us</span>
      <h2 id="location-heading" class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem)">{{ site.address.city }}, Florida</h2>
      <span class="gold-rule"></span>
      <address>
        <p><strong>{{ site.name }}</strong></p>
        <p>{{ site.address.street }}</p>
        <p>{{ site.address.city }}, {{ site.address.state }} {{ site.address.zip }}</p>
        <p style="margin-top:var(--space-sm);"><a href="tel:{{ site.phoneRaw }}" style="text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">{{ site.phone }}</a></p>
        <p><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" style="text-decoration:none;">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
        <p style="margin-top:var(--space-xs);font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--mid-gray);">{{ site.hours.display }}</p>
      </address>
      <a href="{{ site.directionsUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-outline" style="margin-top:var(--space-md);">Get Directions</a>
    </div>
    <div class="fade-up">
      <iframe
        src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=26811+South+Bay+Drive,+Suite+200,+Bonita+Springs,+FL+34134&output=embed"
        title="Foundation Dental Center location map"
        width="100%"
        height="320"
        style="border:0;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);display:block;"
        allowfullscreen=""
        loading="lazy"
        referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
      ></iframe>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
